# Single-block I/O latency (microseconds) mmap vs io_uring, by percentile.
# SOURCE: docs/io_uring_migration/benchmark_results.md
#   "Phase 6: Real-disk re-run on AMD Threadripper PRO 5975WX (2026-07-10)" ->
#     "Single-block per-operation latency (cmp_summary_report, per 256 KB block)".
# Read  p50/p99: mmap 10.9/16.3 us, io_uring 187/222 us.
# Write p50/p99: mmap 117/127 us, io_uring 93/538 us.
# Median across the three cmp_summary_report repeats, 256 KB blocks, Samsung 990
# PRO NVMe, ext4 /dev/nvme0n1p4 (real O_DIRECT), 2026-07-10.
# Re-run on current hardware; supersedes the 2026-02-20 Phase 3 figure.
#
# metric_label      mmap_us  iouring_us
"Read p50"      10.9   187
"Read p99"      16.3   222
"Write p50"     117    93
"Write p99"     127    538
